  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual general contribution to The World Health Organization WHO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution concerns the annual general contribution to The World Health Organization WHO working to connect nations, partners and people to promote health, keep the world safe and serve the vulnerable. The WHO&apos;s official mandate is&#xa0;to promote health and safety while helping the vulnerable worldwide. It provides technical assistance to countries, sets international health standards, collects data on global health issues, and serves as a forum for scientific or policy discussions related to health. The contribution concerns part of the annual general contribution to WHO that is reportable as official development assistance (ODA).</narrative>
  </description>
